{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList"},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSBulletList","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"tvOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","name":"watchOS","beta":false}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","title":"OUDSBulletList","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSBulletListV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSBulletList","kind":"identifier"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbulletlist"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Bullet list is a UI element that helps to view in related individual text items grouped together; items usually starting with a number or a bullet.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Bullet list is also known as ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unordered list"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Ordered list","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and is not an interactive element by default.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/Item"],"anchor":"Structures","generated":true},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/init(type:textStyle:isBold:items:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/TextStyle","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/Type","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/UnorderedAsset"],"anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/View-Implementations"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSBulletList"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/ContentDisplay"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Types","anchor":"Types","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Three types are proposed:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unordered (by default)"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Collects related items that don’t need to be in a specific order or sequence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ordered"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Collects related items with numeric order or sequence."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bare"}]},{"text":": An unordered list without any bullets or alphanumeric sequence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Types can be mixed in list, but must be identical for the same ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSBulletList.NestedLevel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Levels","anchor":"Levels","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Lists can include nested items to indicate hierarchy or subcategories, with indentation distinguishing each level.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Arrange ordered list items logically, such as ranking by importance, highest to lowest values, or in alphabetical \/ numeric order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Three levels are maximum.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Text Style","anchor":"Text-Style","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"List can be used with different font sizes:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Body Large","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If the text accompanying the list component is the Body Large text. This variant is designed for more visual, engaging experiences."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body Medium"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": If the text accompanying the list component is the Body Medium text. This variant is best suited for functional, task-oriented experiences."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Cases-forbidden-by-design","type":"heading","text":"Cases forbidden by design"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"it is not allowed to have a depth of items greater than 3","type":"text"}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Internationalisation-considerations","type":"heading","text":"Internationalisation considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For latin-based speaking countries, like France, Spain, United Kingdom or Belgium, the european “arabic” numbers are used for the first level of depth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the ordered bullet list. For the second and third levels, the european alphabets are used with upper and lower case values."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"However for countries speaking arabic, these rules can’t be applied. Indeed, there is no notion of upper and lower case characters in arabic alphabet."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In addition, the numbers in use (i.e. the european “arabic” numbers like “1, 2, 3”) are accepted in arabic countries, even if the “true arabic” numbers (like “ ٢ ٣ ١”) are used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in middle-east arabic countries and for official documents."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus the OUDS ordered bullet list will use “european” numbers for first level, and arabic alphabets for second and third levels."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["       \/\/ 1. Unordered list with bullets","       OUDSBulletList {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 1.1. Item of Unordered list with bullet as tick, a text style","       \/\/ body medium and text bold","       OUDSBulletList(type: .unordered(asset: .tick),","                      textStyle: .bodyMedium,","                      isBold: true)  {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 2. Bare list with 3 items","       OUDSBulletList(type: .bare) {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 3. Ordered list with 3 items","       OUDSBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 3.1. Ordered list with 3 items in first level,","       \/\/ and one item as sub item (second level),","       \/\/ and 2 items as sub item in (third level)","       OUDSBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\") {","               OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1\") {","                   OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.1\")","                   OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.2\")","               }","           }","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ Same Bullet list but items in third level with free icon as bullet","       let icon = Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\")","       OUDSBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\") {","               OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1\", subListType: .unordered(asset: .icon(icon))) {","                   OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.1\")","                   OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.2\")","               }","           }","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Rich text recommendations","anchor":"Rich-text-recommendations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be applied for bullet list whatever the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isBold"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly within alert messages to highlight key information."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be used for emphasis, as it is commonly associated with links."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined links must be bold."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"If a hyperlink is needed within the content, the underlined style should be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Italic should be used with care, some brands do not allow it like Orange brand.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No other text styles should be used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always check the results of rich text mode with high contrast, light and dark modes, and Voice Over vocalization."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-bullet-list","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_bullet_list_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_bullet_list_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_bullet_list_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"t